{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":20,"code":"PRO","name":"Proverbs","testament":"OT"},"chapter":26,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PRO 26:1"},"As snow in summer, and as rain in harvest, so honour is not seemly for a fool. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PRO 26:2"},"As the bird by wandering, as the swallow by flying, so the curse causeless shall not come. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PRO 26:3"},"A whip for the horse, a bridle for the ass, and a rod for the fool’s back. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PRO 26:4"},"Answer not a fool according to his folly, lest thou also be like unto him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PRO 26:5"},"Answer a fool according to his folly, lest he be wise in his own conceit. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PRO 26:6"},"He that sendeth a message by the hand of a fool cutteth off the feet, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," drinketh damage. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PRO 26:7"},"The legs of the lame are not equal: so ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a parable in the mouth of fools. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PRO 26:8"},"As he that bindeth a stone in a sling, so ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," he that giveth honour to a fool. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PRO 26:9"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["As"]}," a thorn goeth up into the hand of a drunkard, so ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is "]},"a parable in the mouth of fools. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:9"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PRO 26:10"},"The great ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["God"]}," that formed all ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["things"]}," both rewardeth the fool, and rewardeth transgressors. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PRO 26:11"},"As a dog returneth to his vomit, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["so"]}," a fool returneth to his folly. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PRO 26:12"},"Seest thou a man wise in his own conceit? ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is"]}," more hope of a fool than of him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PRO 26:13"},"The slothful ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man"]}," saith, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["There is"]}," a lion in the way; a lion ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," in the streets. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:13"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PRO 26:14"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["As"]}," the door turneth upon his hinges, so ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["doth"]}," the slothful upon his bed. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:14"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PRO 26:15"},"The slothful hideth his hand in ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his"]}," bosom; it grieveth him to bring it again to his mouth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:15"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PRO 26:16"},"The sluggard ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," wiser in his own conceit than seven men that can render a reason. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:16"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PRO 26:17"},"He that passeth by, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," meddleth with strife ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["belonging "]},"not to him, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is like"]}," one that taketh a dog by the ears. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:17"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PRO 26:18"},"As a mad ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man"]}," who casteth firebrands, arrows, and death, ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:18"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PRO 26:19"},"So ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," the man ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," deceiveth his neighbour, and saith, Am not I in sport? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:19"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PRO 26:20"},"Where no wood is, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there"]}," the fire goeth out: so where ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is"]}," no talebearer, the strife ceaseth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:20"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PRO 26:21"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["As"]}," coals ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," to burning coals, and wood to fire; so ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a contentious man to kindle strife. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:21"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PRO 26:22"},"The words of a talebearer ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," as wounds, and they go down into the innermost parts of the belly. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:22"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PRO 26:23"},"Burning lips and a wicked heart ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are like"]}," a potsherd covered with silver dross. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:23"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PRO 26:24"},"He that hateth dissembleth with his lips, and layeth up deceit within him; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:24"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"25","sid":"PRO 26:25"},"When he speaketh fair, believe him not: for ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there are"]}," seven abominations in his heart. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:25"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"26","sid":"PRO 26:26"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["Whose"]}," hatred is covered by deceit, his wickedness shall be shewed before the ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["whole"]}," congregation. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:26"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"27","sid":"PRO 26:27"},"Whoso diggeth a pit shall fall therein: and he that rolleth a stone, it will return upon him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:27"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"28","sid":"PRO 26:28"},"A lying tongue hateth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["those that are"]}," afflicted by it; and a flattering mouth worketh ruin. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 26:28"}]}]}
